{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_0_0_welcome_to_guide",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Prologue, Part 1",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/guide/beg/0_welcome_to_guide.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5a22954023e554baebfdb27c2fa073415cd751a49e0e5eba77ee8c2ceaedad4a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "初始引导\nAh, it's you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's been a long time since we've last seen each other.\nDuring this time... you've been teetering on the edge of a cliff."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You may have forgotten who you are, but just remembering your name is enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...It's time. Don't linger here for too long.\nAfter all, you aren't my guest yet, nor should you even be here.\nShe still needs you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "December 23rd.\nYou may not remember what this date means to you.\nAnd this will thrust you into peril.\n......\nNo...\nYou must try to remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "text": "...consciousness...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "text": "Circulation resumed... vitals stabilized... cardioplegia solution injected...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "text": "Body temperature low... administering Hexamethasone 20 c.c., now...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "text": "Get the hemostat!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "text": "...Conditions stable... beginning resection... be careful of VFib...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "text": "...Sorry...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "text": "For making you suffer again...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Doctor...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "...hand!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Take my...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Take my hand!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Emergency...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "...Help...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "...It's done...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Doctor, Doctor!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Medic, how's Doctor doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "But, just a moment ago... we were holding hands...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "So why... why is Doctor still not waking up...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Amiya! Don't panic, just calm down first!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ah... S-sorry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "You always get so flustered when it comes to the doctor.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "But, Amiya, if the worst came to pass... what would you do then?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...I'm already mentally prepared for that. We would continue to follow the plan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "...I understand. Anyway, I'll do what you requested.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "All right... I appreciate it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "About the Doctor...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Don't worry, Amiya. All the vital signs are stable now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "I'll do one more inspection, just for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Thank you... Thank you very much!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Mhm. Breathing is slightly shallow, but blood pressure is normal. There should be no cause for concern.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Are you awake?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Amiya, it's a success! The Doctor has woken up!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Doctor...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm so happy... Doctor...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Ah, careful! You mustn't do that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Don't try to move yet. Your body still hasn't fully adapted to this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Doctor...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Who... are you?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Ah, Doctor... It's me...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "It's me, Amiya.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We've come to rescue you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...Who... am I...?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You're a member of Rhodes Island, just like us...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...as well as my partner.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...Dr. {@nickname}.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You're the most important person to me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Doctor... you don't remember?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...Can I trust you?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "...",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "I understand. I know this is a bit much to take in right now.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "I don't expect you to remember everything right away, and I'm not asking you to trust me right now.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, do you really not remember me at all...?",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "...",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Even if that's the case... I won't give up.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "We've already sacrificed so much, just to find you...",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I see... Pleased to meet you, Amiya.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "Ah, um, hello.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "...",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "I, I don't know how to put this, but so many things have changed from before.",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "text": "That includes me as well.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "However, you'll always be the most important person to me, Doctor. No matter what happens, this will never change.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "So that's why, please... give me a little more time.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "However little it might be...",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Medic",
          "text": "Does the doctor... really have amnesia?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I'm sure everything will be fine if we give Doctor some space...",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Where is this...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "It's safe here—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Huh? What's happening—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "text": "Amiya, we've got a problem!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "text": "Someone broke into the facility!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "text": "The way they're dressed... they don't look like Ursus soldiers!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "text": "What's the meaning of this?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "text": "They're attacking! Amiya, they're heavily equipped with weapons!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Medic",
          "text": "Aaaahh!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Be careful, everyone! Take cover, and protect Doctor!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "These outfits... are they from the Reunion Movement? But how is that possible...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Guards, prepare for battle!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "text": "Roger!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "text": "Curses... Are they after the Doctor?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "No... Nobody else should know about the Doctor being here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Are you able to reach Kal'tsit?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "text": "I'm not sure why, but the equipment isn't working!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...Someone has cut off our communications.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Have we been discovered by the Ursus government?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "text": "What do we do now?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Kal'tsit won't be able to command the battle as we had originally planned.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...Dr. {@nickname}.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I hope that... you'll be able to take command.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Medic",
          "text": "Isn't that a bit too risky? The Doctor only just came to...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I'd like... to give it a try.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Even without memories, Doctor has...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...fought alongside us before.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Thank you for all of your guidance...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We've been through so much together...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Doctor... I just know that you'll be able to do it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "I know that you'll lead us to victory.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I understand that asking you to do this is very sudden and inconsiderate.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But... Please, lend us your aid.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "We'll be supporting you!",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Let's push them back first!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "We have no choice but to fight back, right?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Mm... I don't want to drag you into this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But right now, we need your wisdom more than ever, Dr. {@nickname}.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I hope that a part of you will reawaken during combat.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Even though you might have doubts about yourself...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "But I believe in you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I know you can do this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Please take command... of Rhodes Island!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
